## Phase 0: Founder setup (ONE-TIME, sebelum Claude Code mulai)

Founder kerjain manual:

- [ ] Daftar IDCloudHost developer account → ambil API key + billing_account_id
- [ ] Daftar Zhipu (open.bigmodel.cn) → ambil GLM-4-Flash API key
- [ ] Daftar Xendit sandbox → ambil secret key
- [ ] Daftar Supabase project → ambil URL + anon key + service role key
- [ ] Buat Telegram bot via @BotFather → ambil token
- [ ] Apply `supabase-schema.sql` di Supabase SQL editor
- [ ] Isi `.env` di tiap package dari `.env.example`

Stop di sini sampai semua di atas done. Tanpa keys, tidak bisa lanjut.

