## Day 2-3 — Pricing page (minimum viable)

**Owner:** Claude Code

**Task:** buat `apps/web/` (Next.js 15 app router) dengan:

- Halaman `/` — landing page sederhana, hero + value prop + CTA "Lihat tier"
- Halaman `/pricing` — 2 tier card (Starter Rp 299.000, Pro Rp 399.000), tombol "Subscribe"
- Tombol Subscribe → POST `/api/checkout` → bikin Xendit invoice → redirect ke invoice URL
- Halaman `/welcome?cid=...` — landing setelah bayar, "agent kamu sedang dipersiapkan"
- Aesthetic: chrome-on-canvas (bg #FAF9F5, ink #141413, accent Liren Blue #0047FF), Inter font, no exclamation marks, max 1 emoji per section.

**Reference:** MyClaw pricing page screenshot (di parent folder). Jangan tiru visual MyClaw — pakai Liren aesthetic.

**Verify:**
- `npx tsc --noEmit` clean
- Pricing page render correctly mobile + desktop
- Subscribe button creates real Xendit sandbox invoice
- Brand voice rules passed (no banned words, no `!`)

